Capability sentinel for the desired-state-workflow probe.

The probe executes committed fixtures under testdata/workflows/desired-state
through the real Ptah CLI. It exercises the Atlas desired-state source model
Ptah implements for `schema diff` and `schema apply` (stokaro/ptah#811):
a live database URL as the `--from` diff source and as the `--to` apply
source, an atlas.sum-covered migration directory replayed on a dev database
(and refused with a deterministic diagnostic before the target database is
contacted when no --dev-url is configured), and an env://src reference
resolved through an evaluated atlas.hcl environment. All databases are
ephemeral SQLite files in the scratch run directory.
